### 1. تسجيل حساب صاحب مطعم (Restaurant Owner)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ahmad Owner",
  "email": "ahmad@restaurant.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "restaurant_owner"
}

### 2. إنشاء مطعم جديد 
POST http://localhost:3000/api/restaurants
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6IjZiMDAxMWJiN2EzNGMwMjBkOTA2YzVlNCIsImlhdCI6MTc5NTE2NjY1MSwiZXhwIjoxNzk1NzcxNDUxfQ.gZXC-QPIJjnbGhTW_OaqWBLumEl3yWmr8T_J9ePqqQA

